    {
      "source": "Simple singleton to convert <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Byte.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Byte</code></a>s to their <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Boolean.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Boolean</code></a> representation. MySQL does not have a built-in\nboolean type by default, so relies on using a byte instead. Non-zero values represent true.",
      "translation": "一个简单的单例，用于将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Byte.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Byte</code></a> 转换为它们的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Boolean.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Boolean</code></a> 表示形式。MySQL 默认没有内置的布尔类型，因此依赖使用字节（byte）代替。非零值代表 true。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the enum constant of this class with the specified name.\nThe string must match <i>exactly</i> an identifier used to declare an\nenum constant in this class.  (Extraneous whitespace characters are \nnot permitted.)",
      "translation": "返回此类的具有指定名称的枚举常量。该字符串必须与用于在此类中声明枚举常量的标识符完全匹配。（不允许存在多余的空白字符。）",
      "count": 1
    },
